rule StarvedBlockedRootCause
	lineageTag: 9a462c24-e69c-5f7d-858c-ee4990637aca
	statement: When a station is Idle because it is Starved, the root cause is the upstream station (position - 1); when it is Blocked, the root cause is the downstream station (position + 1). Telemetry records that station as root_cause_device_id, and the idle time counts against it, not against the idle station.

	ruleReferencedEntity equipment#Machine
		propertyScope: specific
		ruleReferencedProperty idle_reason
		ruleReferencedProperty root_cause_device_id

	ruleReferencedEntity equipment#Station
		propertyScope: specific
		ruleReferencedProperty station_position

	ruleReferencedRelationship equipment#MachineAtStation
